preliminary documentation describing the UCODE microcode language is available
in the file MC:SCHEME;UCODE DOC.  the compiler has a little catching up to do,
but essentially most of the language is now implemented, minus the code generators.

this definition will hopefully be kept up to date as it is my intention to make this
the standard interface between SCHEME and arbitrary machines.

				- chris


